{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-e99aa7345206b7df8cbf","title":"杨阜疏谏曹真军还明帝召军","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-e99aa7345206b7df8cbf","label":"正文","text":"杨阜疏谏曹真军还明帝召军","evidence":["xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"伐蜀遇阻","evidence":["xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0040","role":"上疏","evidence":["xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"召军还","evidence":["xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","order":5081}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0040","name":"杨阜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0038","name":"曹真","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-3e1b006a0ea242b71963","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-5b06f717fd0f4f2baeda","layer":"original","quote":"帝即召诸军还。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-dc60cefa102767ceab61","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-90722337597bf5c5695a","layer":"original","quote":"是时大司马曹真伐蜀〖1〗，遇雨不进。阜上疏曰：“昔文王有赤乌之符〖2〗，而犹日昃不暇食〖3〗；武王白鱼入舟〖4〗，君臣变色〖5〗。而动得吉瑞，犹尚忧惧；况有灾异，而不战竦者哉？今吴、蜀未平，而天屡降变〖6〗；陛下宜深有以专精应答〖7〗，侧席而坐〖8〗；思示远以德，绥迩以俭〖9〗。间者诸军始进，便有天雨之患；稽阂山险〖10〗，已积日矣。转运之劳，担负之苦，所费已多；若有不继，必违本图。《传》曰：‘见可而进〖11〗，知难而退，军之善政也。’徒使六军困于山谷之间，进无所略，退又不得，非主兵之道也。武王还师〖12〗，殷卒以亡，知天期也。今年凶民饥，宜发明诏损膳减服〖13〗；技巧珍玩之物，皆可罢之。昔邵信臣为少府于无事之世〖14〗，而奏罢浮食〖15〗；今者军用不足，益宜节度。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":225,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":338,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
